1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Welcome to this short lesson on release notes.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:07,000
Release notes explain what changed, why it matters, and what users should do next.

3
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:11,000
A good note separates new features, fixes, and known issues.

4
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:15,000
If an update requires action, put that action near the top.

5
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:19,000
Keep the original changelog available so reviewers can verify that nothing was missed.
